{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13111320","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111320","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1311132001:1":{"text":"这走廊两侧的两尊胸像，是为我祖父的祖父而立。","source_cn":"这走廊两侧的两尊胸像，是为我祖父的祖父而立。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x435DBD41592DF321","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311132002:1":{"text":"瓦勒沙家族的历史几乎与白山一样悠久，然而，属于瓦勒沙的历史即将落幕。因为齐格蒙德没有其他子嗣，亚莲娜是他唯一的女儿。","source_cn":"瓦勒沙家族的历史几乎与白山一样悠久，然而，属于瓦勒沙的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x065E7D2C30721996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311132003:1":{"text":"曾经那么鲜活明媚的生命，已经宣告终结。","source_cn":"曾经那么鲜活明媚的生命，已经宣告终结。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1800EE984C598780","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311132004:1":{"text":"柳博米尔先生，为什么你不愿意亚莲娜公主成为亡灵？","source_cn":"柳博米尔先生，为什么你不愿意亚莲娜公主成为亡灵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B02772255C8CE73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311132005:1":{"text":"齐格蒙德想要自己的女儿活着，但亡灵……即便永生，也算不上“活着”，只是存在于这个世界上罢了。","source_cn":"齐格蒙德想要自己的女儿活着，但亡灵……即便永生，也算不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5711A03DD6FF43C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male"